# Everything is excluded, then the pipeline is added back. An allow-list,
# because the default on this folder is the wrong way round: data/ holds the
# Basti master sheet - real names, phone numbers, ages, addresses and
# disability percentages - and a COPY . would bake that into an image layer
# where it survives even if a later layer deletes it.
*

!load_purple.py
!raya_client.py
!transform_purple.py
!requirements.txt
!sql/
!README.md

# Never, under any circumstances:
#   .env                 the Raya key and the Supabase service key
#   data/                the Basti sheet, and generated CSVs
#   describe_columns.py  documentation generator, not pipeline
#   docs/                generated output
#   __pycache__/
